DNA_POOLS.args.family.push('A family is a story everyone tells differently.', 'Parents are forgiven by the time we become them.', 'The family secret is always known by the youngest.', 'Every family has one person who carries the weight.', 'Home is where the old arguments wait for you.', 'We choose our families more often than we admit.', 'Siblings are rivals who share a past.', 'The dinner table is the family\'s parliament.', 'A will tells you who was loved and who was useful.', 'Children forgive faster than parents apologise.', 'Families break along the lines of money.', 'You only meet your parents once they are old.', 'The prodigal child gets the party; the faithful one gets the farm.', 'Every family is a country with its own language.', 'What we inherit most is how to argue.', 'Some families are held together by a lie.', 'Caring for your parents is the last lesson they teach you.', 'Love in families is mostly logistics.', 'The family you make can heal the family you had.', 'A family survives its members by remembering them wrongly.');
DNA_POOLS.args.power.push('Power always looks smaller from the top.', 'Those who want power least use it best.', 'Every revolution needs a quartermaster.', 'The office outlasts the person and corrupts them on the way out.', 'Power is easiest to see when it is taken away.', 'Fear is a cheap way to rule and an expensive way to keep ruling.', 'Influence is power that does not sign its name.', 'A small tyrant is still a tyrant.', 'Real power is the ability to make others wait.', 'The servant knows the master better than the master knows himself.', 'Power shared is power multiplied.', 'Those who climb by stepping on people meet them on the way down.', 'Authority is borrowed from those who obey it.', 'Every empire is built on paperwork.', 'The loudest voice in the room is rarely the one deciding.', 'Power that cannot be questioned cannot be trusted.', 'The kindest rulers are the ones who planned to leave.', 'Control is the comfort of the frightened.', 'Ambition becomes power, and power becomes habit.', 'Whoever writes the minutes decides what happened.');
DNA_POOLS.args.love.push('Love is noticing the small things every day.', 'We love people for their flaws as much as despite them.', 'Love is a promise renewed, not a feeling preserved.', 'Love ends not in a shout but in a shrug.', 'You cannot be loved while you are pretending.', 'Love survives everything except contempt.', 'The person who stays is the person who loves.', 'Romance is the beginning; patience is the story.', 'Love makes cowards brave and the brave careful.', 'We find love when we stop auditioning for it.', 'Old love is quieter and stronger.', 'Love without respect is just appetite.', 'The heart is not a fair judge, but it is an honest one.', 'Letters say what faces cannot.', 'Love asks you to be known, not admired.', 'The right person at the wrong time is still the wrong person.', 'Love is the courage to be ordinary together.', 'Jealousy is love that has forgotten to trust.', 'The kindest love lets the other person change.', 'Love is a country without borders and full of customs officers.');
DNA_POOLS.args.memory.push('Memory is a museum we keep redecorating.', 'The past is never as settled as the history books claim.', 'Forgetting is sometimes a mercy we have not earned.', 'Objects remember for us when we cannot.', 'Every memorial says as much about the living as the dead.', 'A family\'s history is written by its longest survivor.', 'The truth about the past arrives late, like old light.', 'Old photographs lie by smiling.', 'Places keep the shape of what happened in them.', 'We grieve the past because we cannot visit it.', 'Every generation inherits a silence.', 'Remembering wrongly is still a way of loving.', 'Archives are where the powerful hide their mistakes.', 'The last person who remembers is the last door.', 'Memory without forgiveness is just a wound.', 'What we commemorate, we repeat.', 'Songs carry what documents cannot.', 'The past keeps sending letters to the wrong address.', 'History is decided by who keeps the diaries.', 'We are haunted most by what we chose not to see.');
DNA_POOLS.args.identity.push('Identity is a conversation, not a certificate.', 'We become ourselves by disagreeing with our parents.', 'A name chosen is stronger than a name given.', 'The outsider sees the shape of the room.', 'Nobody is native to their own life.', 'We are made of the people who raised us and the people who left.', 'Belonging costs a little of who you were.', 'The uniform changes the person inside it.', 'Being seen clearly is the rarest gift.', 'Every immigrant is two people sharing one passport.', 'We wear our histories like coats we cannot take off.', 'Pride and shame are often the same feeling at different ages.', 'Who we are is what we do when we are tired.', 'The self is renovated, never finished.', 'Labels are maps drawn by strangers.', 'A person can hold two homes and lose neither.', 'We learn who we are by what we refuse.', 'The body knows who it is before the mind does.', 'Inheritance is not destiny, but it is weather.', 'You cannot borrow a self for long.');
DNA_POOLS.args.justice.push('Justice delayed becomes a different kind of injustice.', 'The powerful call it order; the weak call it a fence.', 'A law is only as good as the clerk who applies it.', 'Witnesses are braver than heroes.', 'The truth needs paperwork to win.', 'Every injustice has a bystander who could have spoken.', 'Courts measure what can be proved, not what happened.', 'A town that hides one crime will hide another.', 'Fairness is learned in the playground or not at all.', 'The guilty sleep fine; it is the complicit who lie awake.', 'Accountability is just memory with consequences.', 'A verdict ends a case, not a grief.', 'The people with the least to lose tell the most truth.', 'Mercy is the hardest verdict to hand down.', 'An apology costs nothing and is worth everything.', 'Justice is slow because it has to carry so much.', 'Silence is the cover-up\'s best lawyer.', 'Every law was once someone\'s protest.', 'The worst crimes are usually perfectly legal.', 'A society is judged by its prisons and its hospitals.');
DNA_POOLS.args.survival.push('The will to live is stubborner than the reasons for it.', 'In a crisis, kindness is a strategy.', 'Survival strips people down to what they really are.', 'The ones who make it are rarely the strongest.', 'Hope is practical; despair is lazy.', 'After the disaster comes the harder part.', 'Humour is a survival skill.', 'Every lifeboat holds an argument about who deserves it.', 'People survive for each other more than for themselves.', 'Fear keeps you alive; courage keeps you human.', 'The body forgets pain; the mind forgets nothing.', 'Survival is a daily choice, not a single event.', 'Endurance is boring, and that is its strength.', 'Disasters show who was holding everything together.', 'A shared meal is the first sign of recovery.', 'The survivor\'s guilt is the price of the ticket.', 'Nature is not cruel, only indifferent.', 'To survive, you must sometimes stop fighting.', 'The best shelter is other people.', 'Most of surviving is waiting well.');
DNA_POOLS.args.faith.push('Faith begins where the evidence runs out.', 'A ritual is a promise made with the body.', 'The sacred is what we refuse to sell.', 'God is easier to find in a hospital than a cathedral.', 'Belief is a choice made again every morning.', 'Doubt is a form of respect.', 'The faithful are often the most tired.', 'Prayer changes the person praying.', 'A community of belief can save or smother.', 'Miracles are what we call the help we did not expect.', 'Holiness is mostly patience.', 'Belief that never lifts a hand is only a costume.', 'The old prayers outlast the old gods.', 'Religion is what we do with our fear of death.', 'A lost faith leaves a shape behind.', 'Grace is undeserved by definition.', 'The truest sermon is a kind deed.', 'Heaven is a story we tell to make earth bearable.', 'Every pilgrimage is a journey back to yourself.', 'Faith is trusting the dark to have a floor.');
DNA_POOLS.args.ambition.push('Ambition without kindness eats its owner.', 'The dream changes when you reach it.', 'Talent opens the door; character keeps you in the room.', 'Every success has a private cost.', 'The greatest work is done by people who forgot the prize.', 'Competition makes us better until it makes us worse.', 'Failure is the tuition of mastery.', 'You can be the best and still lose.', 'The ladder looks different from the bottom rung.', 'Fame is a mirror that distorts.', 'Ambition inherited is ambition imprisoned.', 'The first step is always the loneliest.', 'Skill is a thousand dull mornings nobody saw.', 'The people we beat remember us longer than the people we pleased.', 'Hunger fades; discipline remains.', 'Every champion is a former beginner who stubbornly refused to quit.', 'The race is against yourself, and you cheat constantly.', 'Success borrowed from others must be repaid.', 'Mastery is the art of doing ordinary things extraordinarily.', 'The top is crowded with people who wish they had stayed at the bottom.');
DNA_POOLS.args.freedom.push('Freedom is heaviest in the hand that holds it.', 'Every border is a story someone told.', 'The bravest freedom is to stay and change things.', 'Chains can be made of comfort.', 'Liberty is learned, not given.', 'The free are responsible for the unfree.', 'Escape is the start of freedom, not the end.', 'The longest prison sentences are self-imposed.', 'Freedom without purpose is drifting.', 'Every rebel becomes someone\'s authority.', 'Independence is a myth we tell the young.', 'Freedom is choosing what to carry.', 'A closed door can be a shelter or a cell.', 'The open road is only open until you need a mechanic.', 'Freedom grows in the space between two people who trust each other.', 'We fear freedom as much as we want it.', 'The cage door is often opened from the inside.', 'Leaving is easy; arriving is the hard part.', 'Liberty is defended in small rooms by tired people.', 'To be free is to be able to say no.');
DNA_POOLS.args.loneliness.push('Loneliness is a hunger nobody admits to.', 'Small kindnesses are the cure for great loneliness.', 'The lonely recognise each other across a room.', 'Being alone is a skill; being lonely is a wound.', 'Cities are full of people waiting to be asked.', 'Friendship is built from repeated small appointments.', 'Loneliness is contagious, and so is company.', 'The phone that never rings was never given the number.', 'Grief makes everyone lonely for a while.', 'You can talk all day and still not be heard.', 'Every lonely person has a story nobody asked for.', 'Company is not the same as connection.', 'The hardest words are I miss you.', 'A neighbour can be closer than a brother.', 'Loneliness ages us faster than time.', 'Shyness is often mistaken for pride.', 'One good friend is enough to change a life.', 'The lonely keep their homes tidy for visitors who never come.', 'Belonging begins with a shared joke.', 'We are all strangers until someone says our name.');
DNA_POOLS.args.revenge.push('Revenge tastes of ashes the morning after.', 'Hatred is a chain that binds both ends.', 'Vengeance always costs more than the debt.', 'The enemy grows old; the grudge does not.', 'Revenge is a monument to the wound.', 'Forgiveness is the only revenge that ends.', 'The avenger always pays for the shovel.', 'A good life is the one weapon the enemy cannot copy.', 'Every settled score opens a new ledger.', 'Revenge makes the victim into the villain\'s student.', 'The feud outlives the reason for it.', 'Anger is a fire that needs constant feeding.', 'Vengeance turns grief into a career.', 'The avenged dead are still dead.', 'Every act of revenge writes a new grievance.', 'Hatred is an inheritance nobody should accept.', 'Revenge is justice without witnesses.', 'Revenge needs an audience; peace does not.', 'To forgive is not to forget, but to stop rehearsing.', 'The cycle stops with the one who refuses.');

